iza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_55":286},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_190":289},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg>",{"_29":292,"_36":48,"_31":229,"_42":293,"_51":-7,"_11":294,"_53":295},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx","Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview",{"_55":296},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx",{"_36":37,"_31":298,"_39":-7,"_41":-7,"_42":-7,"_44":-7,"_33":299,"_29":307,"_53":308,"_51":310},"Integraciones",[300],{"_29":301,"_36":48,"_31":302,"_42":303,"_51":-7,"_11":304,"_53":305},"es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_55":306},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations",{"_190":309},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"1